,"links":[["Camas County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/idaho/camas-county"],["ARC or PLC in Camas County","/arc-plc/idaho/camas-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, June to July came in under 90% of normal in 42 of the 75 years since 1951 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 14 grids. On that same middle, May to June ran 34% of normal in 2025, and 2026 so far shows May to June at 34% again. Grid 27662 had its driest year in 2013 at 43% of normal.</p>"}
